# AdgenxAI Fusion v2 - JetBrains HTTP Client Tests
# Use with IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, or other JetBrains IDEs

### Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Main Dashboard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: text/html

###

### Chat Endpoint - Basic Test
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Hello from JetBrains HTTP Client!",
  "session_id": "jetbrains_test_session"
}

###

### Chat Endpoint - BeeHive Codex Test
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Execute the BeeHive Codex ritual for Agent-First development pattern analysis.",
  "session_id": "beehive_test"
}

###

### Streaming Endpoint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Stream a detailed explanation of neuromorphic AI orchestration."
}

###

### Rehearsal Endpoint
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/rehearsal
Accept: application/json

###

### Log Export
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/logs/export
Accept: application/json

